---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import WhatsAppButton from '../../components/WhatsAppButton.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About Us & Mining Engineering Heritage"
  description="Over 20 years of applied mechanical engineering solving severe abrasive slurry pumping, flotation, and tailings dewatering. Headquarters in Durango, Mexico."
  lang="en"
  canonicalPath="/en/about/"
  alternateEsPath="/nosotros/"
  alternateEnPath="/en/about/"
>
  <Header slot="header" lang="en" currentPath="/en/about/" alternatePath="/nosotros/" />

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <span class="badge badge-copper">MINING ENGINEERING HERITAGE</span>
      <h1>SMAT Minerals</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Two decades solving severe abrasive wear across Mexican and North American mining operations.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-spacing">
    <div class="container content-container">
      <div class="story-grid">
        <div class="story-text">
          <h2>Origins and Pedigree</h2>
          <p>
            SMAT Minerals was founded over 20 years ago in the heart of northern Mexico's mining belt in Durango.
          </p>
          <p>
            From the very beginning, our purpose was never simply distributing generic parts, but solving the severe physical reality of premature mechanical failure in processing plants where abrasive slurry erodes standard impellers and casings in weeks without proper metallurgy and hydrodynamic balance.
          </p>
          <p>
            Today, we uphold that engineering rigor across every structural skid-mounted pump package, every 50 to 300 ft³ flotation cell, and every replacement impeller cast in certified <strong>High Chrome 27% (A05)</strong> alloy exceeding 650 HB hardness.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card facility-card">
          <h3>Operational Infrastructure & Warehouse</h3>
          <ul class="infra-list">
            <li>
              <strong>Fiscal HQ & Central Warehouse:</strong> Fiscal HQ at Mariano Salas #114, Durango, Mexico, Postal Code 34166. Central Warehouse and loading yard in Durango.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Heavy Hauler Access:</strong> Logistics yard engineered for rigid trucks, tandem heavy haulers, and semi-trailer flatbeds.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Dynamic Balancing in Client Presence:</strong> Every rotating assembly and impeller undergoes dynamic balancing and dimensional verification prior to loading.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Direct Technical Support:</strong> Direct communication between mine maintenance personnel and our Durango engineering team, streamlining parts selection and plant support without bureaucratic delays.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <WhatsAppButton lang="en" />
  <Footer slot="footer" lang="en" />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 4rem 0 3rem;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 80%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .text-center {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .content-container {
    max-width: 1000px;
  }

  .story-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .story-text h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .story-text p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
  }

  .facility-card {
    background-color: #131c2e;
  }

  .facility-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-accent-copper);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .infra-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .infra-list li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .infra-list strong {
    color: #ffffff;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 868px) {
    .story-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
